 "text": "Hi, how are you doing? Once upon a time, there was a young girl named Lily. She had a bright future ahead of her, but that was before the dark night. One night, when Lily was fast asleep, something strange happened. Suddenly, she found herself in a haunted forest. No, not a ghost. It was a mysterious figure in a dark cloak. It is. As Lily walked through the forest, she noticed a bright moon shining above, casting eerie shadows on everything. The figure whispered, Come with me. As Lily followed, she realized she had no idea where she was going.",
